<p>You use your rocket pods to launch yourself into the air for 3 turns, firing a radius 2 barrage of rockets that deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">178%, 202%, 220%, 236%, 250%</acronym> steamgun damage as fire in radius 2. </p><p>While flying you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">400%, 472%, 536%, 595%, 650%</acronym> movement speed, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 22%, 30%, 35%, 39%</acronym> chance to evade melee and ranged attacks, and can reactivate this talent at will to repeat the rocket barrage.</p><p>Using any talent other than Rocket Barrage will end this effect immediately.</p>